{
    "title": "VeVe Comics Reader",
    "description": "The future of comics is here! VeVe Comics is here to revolutionize digital comics and collecting. This free app is built with the comic book reader in mind by passionate comic book readers and collectors, to bring fans non-subscription access to premium, licensed digital comic books and a fan-centric approach to reading and collecting.  Digital comics purchased from VeVe Comics and VeVe will automatically appear in your VeVe Comics reader app - simply login upon your first purchase at VeVe Comics.\r\n\r\nSame Day as Print\r\n\r\nWith instant delivery and digital comics released on the same day as print, you\u2019ll no longer need to wait for the next thrilling installment. \r\n\r\nOrganize your Collection\r\n\r\nKeep track of all your comics and easily sort your comic books using Quick Lists. \r\n\r\nEasy to Read\r\n\r\nOur reader app makes it easy to access your comic book collection anytime, anywhere! Read your comics online or offline. With our interactive smart paneling technology, we have meticulously hand authored every panel to allow for a guided reading experience to put you in the heart of the story.\r\n\r\nDiscover More\r\n\r\nVeVe Comics is a multi publisher platform offering comic book enthusiasts access to buy new release comics on the same day titles are released in print. New comics are added weekly from our first publisher partner, Marvel Comics.\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2024 Marvel",
    "descriptionHTML": "The future of comics is here! VeVe Comics is here to revolutionize digital comics and collecting. This free app is built with the comic book reader in mind by passionate comic book readers and collectors, to bring fans non-subscription access to premium, licensed digital comic books and a fan-centric approach to reading and collecting.  Digital comics purchased from VeVe Comics and VeVe will automatically appear in your VeVe Comics reader app - simply login upon your first purchase at VeVe Comics.<br><br>Same Day as Print<br><br>With instant delivery and digital comics released on the same day as print, you\u2019ll no longer need to wait for the next thrilling installment. <br><br>Organize your Collection<br><br>Keep track of all your comics and easily sort your comic books using Quick Lists. <br><br>Easy to Read<br><br>Our reader app makes it easy to access your comic book collection anytime, anywhere! Read your comics online or offline. With our interactive smart paneling technology, we have meticulously hand authored every panel to allow for a guided reading experience to put you in the heart of the story.<br><br>Discover More<br><br>VeVe Comics is a multi publisher platform offering comic book enthusiasts access to buy new release comics on the same day titles are released in print. New comics are added weekly from our first publisher partner, Marvel Comics.<br><br>\u00a9 2024 Marvel",
